//! MonsterNode: the hot-path KASM execution node.
//!
//! Sprint 1 refactor: the four `Mutex<VecDeque<...>>` caches were
//! collapsed into:
//!  * `cache`    â€” unified memo+result map, indexed by `CallKey`.
//!  * `programs` â€” verified-and-prepared `HotProgram` map.
//!  * `lru`      â€” small bookkeeping queue of recent `CallKey`s.
//!  * `oracles`  â€” affine learner state, one entry per program.
//!  * `stats_atomic` â€” atomic counters; `stats()` snapshots on demand.
//!
//! Sub-modules: `cache`, `exec`, `hotplan`, `oracle`, `swarm_io`,
//! `stats`. The struct lives here so every sibling `impl` block sees
//! the `pub(in crate::monster)` fields.

